# PayPal — create your own REST app at https://developer.paypal.com/dashboard/applications
# (Sandbox app while testing, Live app once you're ready to take real money).
# VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID is public and safe to commit; it is the "Client ID" shown there.
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET must stay out of the repo — set it as a real environment
# variable / secret on whatever hosts this app (Cloudflare, Lovable Secrets, etc.),
# never here.
VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=""
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=""
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=""
# "sandbox" (default, safe — fake money) or "live" (real charges).
PAYPAL_ENV="sandbox"
